--TEST--
A `static` property is not one of a property key's names, so a literal that names one is `E0405`, and the error lists only the instance properties
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Visitor {
    public static int $count = 0;
    public string $name = "a";
}

property<Visitor> $key = "count" as property<Visitor>;
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0405]: `Visitor` has no public property `$count`
  --> case.nvs:7:26
%A
  = help: %s: `$name`
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
